plications, from computer vision and natural language processing to human-computer interaction and robotics. As AI systems continue to evolve and improve, we can expect to see significant advances in this area, leading to more powerful, flexible, and intuitive AI systems that can collaborate effectively across multiple modalities.'}, 'choose model result': {'id': 'ChatGPT', 'reason': 'ChatGPT performs well on some NLP tasks as well.'}}, 1: {'task': {'task': 'summarization', 'id': 1, 'dep': [0], 'args': {'text': 'AI systems collaborate across modalities'}}, 'inference result': {'response': 'The key theme in "AI systems collaborate across modalities" is the ability of artificial intelligence systems to work together and share information across different forms of data, such as text, images, and speech. This collaboration enables AI systems to leverage the strengths of each modality, leading to more accurate and comprehensive understanding and decision-making. The theme highlights the importance of multimodal interaction and the potential for AI systems to learn from and adapt to different types of data, ultimately enhancing their overall performance and capabilities.'}, 'choose model result': {'id': 'ChatGPT', 'reason': 'ChatGPT performs well on some NLP tasks as well.'}}, 2: {'task': {'task': 'text-classification', 'id': 2, 'dep': [1], 'args': {'text': 'AI systems collaborate across modalities'}}, 'inference result': {'error': 'no available models on text-classification task.'}, 'choose model result': ''}}
